			"Message": "feat: Implement Sky Bridge for Diagnostics, SCM, and Search\n\n- Added InstallDiagnostics.ts to bridge diagnostics from Mountain to IMarkerService, enabling error visibility in the editor.\n- Introduced InstallScm.ts to handle SCM events, allowing Sky-side viewlets to mirror SCM state and register providers against the live workbench service.\n- Created InstallSearch.ts to register a search result provider that routes search queries to Mountain's handlers, ensuring proper file and text search functionality.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "c6982bf52f64f2f9ef7a60e23743af8ba103ca2d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-20T04:38:18Z",
